==Strategy==
A simple stage, use the [[:Category:Normal Cats|Normal Cats]] to easily beat it. Due to [[Master A.]] being at 100% magnification, using [[Lizard Cat (Normal Cat)|Dragon Cat]] for quick damage works rather well against him, as well as [[Fish Cat (Normal Cat)|Whale Cat]] and [[Titan Cat (Normal Cat)|Mythical Titan Cat]] being able to tank his attacks while also dealing damage at the same time.

